{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not continue arbitrary hooks after a JVM-fatal error.** This catches `VirtualMachineError` and `ThreadDeath` and continues invoking the remaining plugins. If a later hook blocks, the fatal condition never escapes; continuing application cleanup is also unsafe in a potentially corrupted JVM. Re-throw JVM-fatal errors immediately and aggregate only nonfatal errors. Add a fatal-first, blocking-later regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-Dt72","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":113,"observation_digest":"ac7a25a9d50e74b01d67b13aed08e097c7c78cf7f91c9d530431c5f16ede083c","observation_id":"aro_v1_vr5clkovbz2lahlhwe5o2chas7","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aijmadpi5elrp5dx77z56tmy35","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"3fab2d713e2b248ca27f12a6569529ba46388ff6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_lhoz5byezlpffehxubpjek2urk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
